    "title_en": "5d $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ S-folds and Seiberg--Witten curves",
    "abstract_en": "We compute the Seiberg--Witten curves for $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ S-folds of five-dimensional $\\mathcal{N}=1$ rank-1 superconformal field theories. Two complementary constructions are presented. First, we implement the $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ action by identifying pairs of points on the original curve, thereby mapping them to a single point on the S-folded curve. Second, motivated by arXiv:2112.14550, we tune mass parameters to special values, corresponding to the insertion of $D_4$ 7-branes. As a nontrivial consistency check, we show that the two Seiberg--Witten curves agree with each other when expressed in the Weierstrass normal form.",
